{{velocity}}
A temporary tool for the one time transfer of sensitivity values from the old Confluence macro into the Sensitivity Banner fields. It needs the Sensitivity Banner extension.

Use it from //Administration, Content, Sensitivity Migration//.

**When the migration is finished, delete this space** (this page and all of its child pages) to remove the tool. The sensitivity values already stored on pages are not affected.
{{/velocity}}
